6: // tests run it with scripted reviewers and the CLI (bin/pantheon-review-cycle.mjs) passes a live one.
7: //
8: // A reviewer that fails (a 503, a refused review) leaves the cycle open with fewer reviews than it
9: // needs, and the next cycle of the scope cannot open until it closes. `resume: true` is the supported
10: // way on (independent review 2026-11-16, C2): it reopens THAT cycle, never a new one, and tries again
11: // only the seats with no review, under the cycle's own bound brief and change, keeping every review
12: // already recorded. Every try is a `cycle.attempt` entry, failures with their reason, and a seat stops
